    merge, so they were not exported.
  - 2 cut segment(s) could not be chained within the normal weld tolerance; affected
    caps preserved their real edge order and closed the final numerical seam.
  - Intact collision uses 2 compound convex parts because the source contains disconnected
    mesh islands.
